2665:Source/html/document.c ****                    element's children and its own tag EXIT. The inline
2666:Source/html/document.c ****                    `` sites were removed: they ran
2667:Source/html/document.c ****                    before children were walked, so inert never applied below. */
2668:Source/html/document.c ****                 walk_push();
